WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.215
Time-out: tap the team's "TO" box.

2
00:00:03.265 --> 00:00:07.309
"Confirm time-out" starts the 30 seconds.

3
00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:09.824
"Stop timeout" ends it early.

4
00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:11.932
Substitution: tap the player who goes out.

5
00:00:11.982 --> 00:00:15.820
Then "Substitution" and the player who comes in.

6
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.509
Check OUT and IN, then "Yes".

7
00:00:19.559 --> 00:00:22.776
Number 9 is on court, the "SUB" counter shows 1.

8
00:00:22.826 --> 00:00:26.529
Next rally: B wins it, A receives.

9
00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:32.577
Libero: tap a back-row player, then "Libero" and the libero.

10
00:00:32.627 --> 00:00:34.992
The libero is on court, without a substitution.

11
00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:37.596
At the rotation to the front row, the libero goes out by itself.
